      "default": "Venustas Presents Revolutionary 3-in-1 Heated Down Jacket 7.4V: Your Ultimate Winter Wardrobe Essential"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_f95d9714_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "Venustas has elevated the winter jacket game with its versatile 3-in-1 design. Crafted to withstand unpredictable weather, this heated jacket offers superior comfort, durability, and functionality, ideal for the adventurous spirits navigating through harsh winter elements."
