      "label": "Heading2 — Value",
      "default": "Venustas Men’s Heated Jacket 7.4V: A Comprehensive Review"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_e129ef27_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "My quest to find the perfect companion for my outdoor adventures led me to the Venustas Men’s Heated Jacket 7.4V. As someone who’s always on the lookout for gear that enhances my outdoor experience without compromising on comfort or style, I was intrigued to see just how this jacket would perform."
