    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_e3f4938b_value",
      "label": "Heading2 — Value",
      "default": "Gear Spotlight: The Venustas Heated Vest 7.4V – An In-Depth Review\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_938b2d60_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "The Rise of Heated Apparel\n\nThe popularity of heated apparel has soared in recent years, driven by advancements in heating technology and a growing appreciation for outdoor recreation. This surge in demand can be attributed to several factors, including the desire to extend outdoor adventures into colder months and the need for gear that provides customizable warmth in varying weather conditions. Heated clothing, such as the Venustas Heated Vest, has emerged as a game-changer for outdoor enthusiasts, offering a reliable source of warmth that adapts to the wearer’s needs."
    },
