      "id": "pf_44197d2c_value",
      "label": "Heading2 — Value",
      "default": "The 8 Best Heated Jackets for the Most Frigid Winters\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_7d2c2466_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "Whether you’re getting ready to break out the skis and snowboards or just relax by your backyard campfire, winter means prepping for staying warm through all your favorite seasonal activities. Even though your go-to down jacket and winter boots are insulated, they don’t generate actual heat, making whipping winds or long days outside even colder."
