      "label": "Heading2 — Value",
      "default": "My Journey with the Venustas Women’s Heated Jacket\n\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_442f55e0_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "Embarking on a journey through the brisk days of winter, I recently had the opportunity to try out the Venustas Women’s Heated Jacket. Amidst the myriad of options for winter wear, this jacket stood out with its promise of combining modern heating technology with everyday comfort and style."
