      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_10b7364d_value",
      "label": "Heading2 — Value",
      "default": "Venustas Black Friday Deals: Winter's Warmth Brought to Your Doorstep\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_6f165c2d_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "Venustas introduces its groundbreaking Heated Vests at irresistible prices, ensuring warmth and comfort for winter enthusiasts. Originally priced at $139.99, both Men's and Women's Heated Vests are now an absolute steal at $97.99, an incredible 30% discount. Powered by a high-capacity 7.4V battery, these vests provide extended warmth for up to 8 hours, covering larger heating areas across the body. Fashioned from breathable Nylon fabric, they not only deliver comfort but also facilitate on-the-go device charging through their USB port. For added convenience, these machine-washable essentials come complete with a battery pack and carry bag, ensuring warmth and portability for your adventures.\n\n"
    },
