    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_9ef62aa7_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "\"Now, we are in the season of sale. Black Friday Holiday provides a great opportunity for us to connect with our new customers and long-term customers. To let everyone enjoy the festive mood, we take the advantage of this special holiday to launch the exciting plans,\" Said Michael Lee, CEO of VENUSTAS."
