    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_b3314c59_value",
      "label": "Heading2 — Value",
      "default": "Venustas Heated Apparel Announces the Good News about New Arrivals This Week\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_4c595ee1_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "\"Last week, we launched a new product to greet the upcoming winter. That's the women's heated sailing jacket. It comes with the all-new design and ultimate performance, which won unprecedented approval\" Venustas CEO Michael said.\n\nThis heated sailing jacket is designed for women with various features. It adopts 5 heating elements to cover warmth with the core body areas, dispelling the bitter cold in winter. Crafted with water-repellent fabric, the jacket keeps users dry and warm in winter sailing, boating, fishing, etc."
