    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_a84478f4_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "“To cover more about us, we decide to release the story behind the brand to the public for the first time.”, said Venustas CEO. It is a simple but romantic story. It happened in the Rocky mountains of Colorado. It proves one man’s endless love for his wife. That’s the origin of Venustas."
