    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_875e89fd_value",
      "label": "Heading2 — Value",
      "default": "Venustas Heated Apparel Introduces An Innovative Change In White-Duck Down Heated Vests\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_89fde12a_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "What Is Heated Clothing?\nRegular thick coats keep people warm simply by trapping body heat, so adding layers is the only method when someone wants to get warmer. However, with heated apparel, things will become different."
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_e12acd06_value",
      "label": "Button2 — Value",
      "default": "<u>View More</u>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_17650525_value",
      "label": "Heading2 — Value",
      "default": "Amanda Bowman"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_25d3c5ce_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "October 20, 2021"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_08a1d820_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "EINNEWS"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_d820fdc6_value",
      "label": "Heading2 — Value",
      "default": "Venustas Heated Apparel Announces A Brand New Graphene Pullover Heated Hoodie\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_fdc6d3d1_value",
      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "What Is Heated Clothing?\nWinter outerwear is hardly changed for hundreds of years—a thick and insulated shell that traps heat for you to keep warm. But things went different when the first heated apparel was released. It's obvious that the heated outerwear has a heating system, which means it can generate heat itself. And its supporting battery can provide long-lasting power whenever you need it, which makes it a lifesaver when the heat generated by your body is not enough to keep you warm.\nOf course, when it comes to the heating system, the material of heating elements matters a lot."
    },
    {
